 =-\frac{d\log Z}{d\beta}.$ 取自然对数，因为它的导数正好给出因子 $1/Z$。

p.src:
The position integral is immediate. The Hamiltonian is independent of position, and each particle may lie anywhere in the box: $\int_{V^N}d^{3N}q=V^N.$ The momentum integral factorizes into $3N$ identical one-dimensional Gaussian integrals: $Z_N
 =\frac{V^N}{N!\,h^{3N}}
 \left[
  \int_{-\infty}^{\infty}dp\,
  e^{-\beta p^2/(2m)}
 \right]^{3N}.$

