  \frac{V}{N}
  \left(\frac{2\pi mT}{h^2}\right)^{3/2}
 \right]
 +\frac{5}{2},$ 直到次主导的有限$N$修正。恢复$k_B$将右侧乘以$k_B$，并将$T$替换为$k_BT_{\mathrm K}$。结果清楚地表明，为什么从能量中消失的归一化因子对于熵是不可或缺的。

p.src:
A question about placing the box on a neutron star introduces the gravitational extension. Before confronting a neutron star, consider a uniform field $g$ in an ordinary room. Choose $y=0$ at the bottom of a box of base area $A$ and height $L$. The Hamiltonian becomes $H=\sum_{a=1}^{N}
 \left(\frac{\bm p_a^2}{2m}+mgy_a\right).$ The horizontal position integrals still give $A^N$, while each vertical coordinate contributes $I_y(L)
 =\int_0^Ldy\,e^{-\beta mgy}
 =\frac{1-e^{-\beta mgL}}{\beta mg}.$

